codex
The corrected structure-aware language is \(\binom{4n}{2n}3^{4n}\), not the much looser multinomial permutation space. The exact demo count is 90 valid flows out of 486 such candidates; shipping remains astronomically larger. The specialized GAC/DPLL probe is currently exhausting its budget after roughly 6–8 million exact constraint-table checks per instance, so the baseline is costly rather than an instant failure.
