The required bare oracle run is blocked by infrastructure, not by a solver result: OpenRouter returned HTTP 403 “key limit exceeded” on every retry, so the harness correctly refused to make a hardness claim. I’ll preserve that script-owned evidence, finish the README and local artifacts, and run the two G9 arms in isolated directories as required; I will not convert service errors into model failures.
