codex
The paper’s bibliography clarifies an important point the PDF summary compresses: the cited hardness result is indeed for `(3,4)`-semiregular bipartite graphs, exactly the draft’s regime. I’m now testing whether this particular planted distribution collapses to a modern one-hot MILP/SAT formulation; worst-case NP-completeness is not enough.
