+    vertex is equivalent to a perfect matching: put the two sign types on
+    opposite sides, and join two variables when they meet at a degree-4 vertex.
+    A matched pair chooses that common degree-4 vertex.  Equality of the two
+    selected counts at every degree-4 vertex is then automatic.
+    """
